These are new fortunes that can be patched to any version of NetHack.

They are based off the Van Halen song, "Right Now". I apologize for
them not being in EXACT alphabetical order, and it is a rather short
patch, but it is intended for you to insert your OWN witty "Right now"
sayings and make them tailored to your needs and humor. :)

Open your NetHack file labeled "rumors" with a Text editor and insert
these saying plus whatever else you like.

Right now, Dan Quayle still has no idea of what's going on.
Right now, don't you wish you had Stormbringer?
Right now, Disco is alive and well in Mexico.
Right now, The Wizard is being forced to let Gays back into his army.
Right now, The Gods are betting on you to lose...again.
Right now, The Gods are shaking their heads in disbelief.
Right now, there is no cure for AIDS, baldness or the common cold.
Right now, time is having it's way with you.
Right now, people the world over are reading rec.games.hack.
Right now, Leprechauns are being robbed of their sole possesion.
Right now, another hacker is reading YAFM.
Right now, Steve Jobs is wishing he'd stayed with Apple.
Right now is better than five years from now.
Right now, President Kennedy's murderers have yet to face justice.
Right now, Ross Perot is planning his '96 Presidential Campaign.
Right now, k. d. lang still refuses to capitalize her name.
Right now, President Clinton still can't figure out the White House phones.
Right now, One billion dollars ago was yesterday.
Right now, The Wizard of Yendor is laughing at you.
Right now, The Gods are killing babies, because they have to.

